{"candidateAnswer":"beef stew, shepherds pie, banana bread, ramen","evidence":"[D3:18 | 4:19 pm on 16 April, 2023] Audrey: Wow, sounds amazing! Glad you got to enjoy them. Since you metioned pastries, I made some of my favorite treats last week. Let's have a pastry party sometime! \n[D10:13 | 8:32 pm on 3 July, 2023] Audrey: I love cooking! My favorite recipe is Chicken Pot Pie. It's so cozy and delicious, especially on a cold day. If you want, I can share the recipe with you.\n[D10:23 | 8:32 pm on 3 July, 2023] Audrey: Sure! Roasted Chicken is one of my favorites - sure I'll send you the recipe in a bit.\n[D25:6 | 10:14 am on 24 October, 2023] Audrey: Yess! Sushi is delicious! I love them! There are so many types and flavors to try. Definitely give it a go and try different things! Don't limit yourself in your comofort zone!","itemId":"urn:uuid:d5711c77-0fd4-5bb5-a678-430a0bdb3f1a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7210aace67ba6171d866dcb6072e44eea5027ad7bae895ae0e1375900dbfe8b6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are some foods that Audrey likes eating?","referenceAnswer":"chicken pot pie, chicken roast, blueberry muffins, sushi","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7210aace67ba6171d866dcb6072e44eea5027ad7bae895ae0e1375900dbfe8b6"}}]}